;; This advisory selection order is not a cross-model benchmark. Callers
;; may still pass model identifiers that are not listed here.
;; :knowledge_cutoff is present only where the vendor publishes a reliable
;; cutoff; the sources are listed in docs/model-catalog-sources.md. A missing
;; cutoff is reported as "unknown", never estimated.
